<title>UK: Kvaerner U.S. unit wins $67 mln orders.</title>
<headline>Kvaerner U.S. unit wins $67 mln orders.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwegian industrial group Kvaerner ASA said on Monday its U.S. unit Kvaerner Construction Inc. had won new orders worth $67 million.</p>
<p>Kvaerner said the orders included two school construction and redevelopment contracts worth $28 million each and a $11 million construction management contract for a health and public affairs building.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
